three months in Jerusalem. 3 Joahaz appointed the priests who offered thanksgiving unto the LORD this way:
Forze: And the priests who were the chief fathers were, the priests of the First month; Jashobeam, the son of Achan from the chief house, the chief father;
Of Zebechem; Jezan, a Sumeite from Gath, chief;
Forzacharim; Zicri from Bochkiz; Amziam, chief father of Zecaraim. Forzaquem, the main parents; Zebimai, the first house. Johannathan, the son of Josheath the first father. Of Jashueth the house; Jozadach. Zikrin. Johanan, chief. Zachem the second father. Johoham, of Gideon, the third house father. Jekamehem. Jehoiakim; Jehoidah. Jeho

